>>
endobj
1302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E (Last season we used a Google Coral Edge TPU with a quantized TFLite model. This season we moved to an HSV pipeline for simpler deployment \(no TPU driver stack\), faster iteration on colour thresholds, and elimination of the TPU as a failure point. To handle lighting variation we run the pipeline in both HSV and LAB colour spaces \(USE_LAB flag\) and tune thresholds per colour class.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
