/Pg 60 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1524 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3689 0 R
/E (Number of Cores: We decided to switch to the Raspberry Pi 4B as its quad-core cortex allows it to run 4 processes at once, whereas the Arduno Mega can only run 1. )
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1525 0 obj
<<
